### Context Analysis
Based on the source text from the novel **"Tu Chân Bốn Vạn Năm"** ([Tu Chân Bốn Vạn Năm_Ngọa Ngưu Chân Nhân.txt](file:///mnt/sdcard/My%20Agent/Transbot/Source/Source%20full/Tu%20Ch%C3%A2n%20B%E1%BB%91n%20V%E1%BA%A1n%20N%C4%83m_Ng%E1%BB%8Da%20Ng%C6%B0u%20Ch%C3%A2n%20Nh%C3%A2n.txt#L660-L683)), these strings represent segments extracted from the early chapters describing cultivation techniques and narrative dialogues:
* **`鲸吞大法`** is an approved terminology representing a specific cultivation technique (Sino-Vietnamese: *Kình Thôn Đại Pháp*).
* **`一百零八手披`** is a truncated fragment of the full martial technique name **`一百零八手披风乱锤法`** (*Nhất Bách Linh Bát Thủ Phi Phong Loạn Chùy Pháp*). It is marked as **uncertain** because it is incomplete but refers to a valid term.
* The remaining terms (**`修炼不到家，`**, **`果然是一个字`**, **`的疯狂消化吸`**, **`要是练不好，`**, **`，这是专门教`**) are rejected as they represent sentence fragments, common phrases, or contain trailing/leading punctuation.

